>> libname := Polokalamu hoʻonohonoho: ['FFITESTLIB'].
Server loulou: (
 Papa hou ;
 libname ;
 ['putchar'] ;
 ( Papa hou ; ['char'] ) ;
 ['void'] ;
 ['Print'] ;
 ['char:']
).
Print char: (x mai: 0 lōʻihi: 1), laina-hou.
x hoʻokuʻu.

